AttestationSigil::check1271
├── given an unconfigured config id
│   └── it should revert (PolicyNotInitialized)
├── given an allowlisted requesting dApp
│   ├── and no hash allowlist
│   │   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS for any hash
│   ├── and the real hash is allowlisted
│   │   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS
│   └── and the real hash is NOT allowlisted
│       └── it should return VALIDATION_FAILED
├── given a non-allowlisted requesting dApp
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_FAILED (anti-phishing)
├── given the ANY_SENDER (address(0)) wildcard is configured
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS for any requesting dApp
├── given an empty sender allowlist
│   └── it should return VALIDATION_FAILED for every request (default-deny)
├── given several allowlisted dApps
│   ├── it should accept each allowlisted dApp
│   └── it should reject an off-list dApp
├── given several allowlisted hashes
│   ├── it should accept each allowlisted hash
│   └── it should reject an off-list hash
└── given the gate must bind to the REAL hash (security)
    ├── and an allowlisted-looking content blob is paired with a mismatched real hash
    │   └── it should return VALIDATION_FAILED (content cannot rescue a wrong hash)
    └── and the allowlisted hash is paired with any content blob
        └── it should return VALIDATION_SUCCESS (the hash gates, not the content)
